		{
			dependencies: ["46082C1C195DA870"]
			description: [
				"&bGraphite Molds&r are essential components used for casting molten metals with the &bCasting Table&r. Each mold determines what shape the molten metal will take when poured."
				""
				"They come in several types for creating different materials such as &eingots&r, &7plates&r, &6rods&r, and &bwires&r."
				""
				"Make them all to fully master the art of metal casting and expand your foundry’s capabilities."
