		{
			dependencies: ["46082C1C195DA870"]
			description: [
				"To progress further into Create Metallurgy, you must travel to &cThe Nether&r and mine some &eWolframite Ore&r."
				""
				"Wolframite can be refined into &bTungsten&r, a key material used to craft the &bFoundry Mixer&r and &cIndustrial Crucible&r."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"It can generate anywhere in the Nether, but it is most easily found in the &4Nether Wastes&r, its green texture makes it stand out clearly against the red netherrack. It's easier to spot without shaders."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/wolframite_ore_nether.png width:150 height:150 align:center}"
