		{
			dependencies: ["4B19102F5BF94070"]
			description: [
				"The &bFoundry Mixer&r unlocks &6molten metal alloying&r and advanced material mixing."
				""
				"To craft it, you must first create a &bSturdy Whisk&r, an essential component that puts your metalworking skills to the test."
				""
				"This step requires you to learn how to cast &bMolten Tungsten&r into &7Tungsten Sheets&r, which are then used to craft the whisk."
				""
				"Only once you’ve mastered this process will you be ready to assemble the Foundry Mixer and begin alloying."
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"The Foundry Mixer must be placed above a &bGlassed Foundry Lid&r. This can be done by right-clicking the lid with a wrench."
				""
				"Once assembled, consult &eJEI&r for all available recipes that can be made using the Foundry Mixer."
			]
