			description: [
				"The &cIndustrial Crucible&r is the pinnacle of your molten metal journey."
				""
				"It is designed for &6bulk melting&r of ores and materials, handling large quantities with unmatched efficiency. In addition, it’s powerful enough to &cmelt entities&r that fall inside, unlocking the true strength of your foundry setup."
				""
				"The Industrial Crucible can also be used for &bmetal alloying&r on a massive scale with the Foundry Unit. Consult the &ePonder&r for more information. "
